   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Stock-based compensation expense relating to the Long-Term Incentive Plan (&#8220;LTIP&#8221;), including restricted stock units (&#8220;RSUs&#8221;) and performance restricted stock units (&#8220;PRSUs&#8221;) for the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>&#160;was $<ix:nonFraction id="c147555977" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RSUAndPRUsMember_PlanNameAxis-LTIPMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">9.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c147555978" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RSUAndPRUsMember_PlanNameAxis-LTIPMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">15.9</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively.&#160;Stock-based compensation expense relating to LTIP RSUs and PRSUs for the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2025</em>&#160;was $<ix:nonFraction id="c147555981" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RSUAndPRUsMember_PlanNameAxis-LTIPMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">7.1</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c147555982" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RSUAndPRUsMember_PlanNameAxis-LTIPMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">13.7</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively.</p>
