   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">During the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">six</em>&#160;months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c147555984" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">1,313,819</ix:nonFraction>&#160;RSUs and <ix:nonFraction id="c147555985" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-PerformanceRestrictedStockUnitsMember" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">366,711</ix:nonFraction>&#160;PRSUs were granted to employees and directors at a weighted average grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction id="c147555986" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">16.82</ix:nonFraction>&#160;per RSU and $<ix:nonFraction id="c147555987" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_AwardTypeAxis-PerformanceRestrictedStockUnitsMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">22.72</ix:nonFraction> per PRSU.</p>
